        "Ссылки vless://, vmess://, trojan://, ss://, hysteria2://, tuic://, wireguard:// открываются в Tutun по клику.": ["vless://, vmess://, trojan://, ss://, hysteria2://, tuic://, wireguard:// links open in Tutun when clicked.", "Посилання vless://, vmess://, trojan://, ss://, hysteria2://, tuic://, wireguard:// відкриваються в Tutun після кліку.", "Los enlaces vless://, vmess://, trojan://, ss://, hysteria2://, tuic://, wireguard:// se abren en Tutun al hacer clic.", "点击 vless://、vmess://、trojan://、ss://、hysteria2://、tuic://、wireguard:// 链接时会在 Tutun 中打开。", "vless://, vmess://, trojan://, ss://, hysteria2://, tuic://, wireguard:// लिंक क्लिक करने पर Tutun में खुलते हैं।", "تُفتح روابط vless:// وvmess:// وtrojan:// وss:// وhysteria2:// وtuic:// وwireguard:// في Tutun عند النقر عليها.", "Les liens vless://, vmess://, trojan://, ss://, hysteria2://, tuic://, wireguard:// s’ouvrent dans Tutun au clic.", "vless://, vmess://, trojan://, ss://, hysteria2://, tuic://, wireguard:// লিংকে ক্লিক করলে Tutun-এ খোলে।", "Links vless://, vmess://, trojan://, ss://, hysteria2://, tuic://, wireguard:// abrem no Tutun ao serem clicados.", "vless://, vmess://, trojan://, ss://, hysteria2://, tuic://, wireguard:// لنکس کلک کرنے پر Tutun میں کھلتے ہیں۔", "Tautan vless://, vmess://, trojan://, ss://, hysteria2://, tuic://, wireguard:// dibuka di Tutun saat diklik.", "Links vless://, vmess://, trojan://, ss://, hysteria2://, tuic://, wireguard:// öffnen sich per Klick in Tutun.", "vless://、vmess://、trojan://、ss://、hysteria2://、tuic://、wireguard://のリンクは、クリックするとTutunで開きます。", "vless://, vmess://, trojan://, ss://, hysteria2://, tuic://, wireguard:// लिंक क्लिक केल्यावर Tutun मध्ये उघडतात.", "vless://, vmess://, trojan://, ss://, hysteria2://, tuic://, wireguard:// లింక్‌లు క్లిక్ చేసినప్పుడు Tutunలో తెరుచుకుంటాయి.", "vless://, vmess://, trojan://, ss://, hysteria2://, tuic://, wireguard:// bağlantıları tıklandığında Tutun’da açılır.", "vless://, vmess://, trojan://, ss://, hysteria2://, tuic://, wireguard:// இணைப்புகள் கிளிக் செய்தால் Tutun இல் திறக்கும்.", "Liên kết vless://, vmess://, trojan://, ss://, hysteria2://, tuic://, wireguard:// sẽ mở trong Tutun khi nhấp.", "vless://, vmess://, trojan://, ss://, hysteria2://, tuic://, wireguard:// 링크를 클릭하면 Tutun에서 열립니다."],
        "Копия сохранена": ["Backup saved", "Копію збережено", "Copia de seguridad guardada", "备份已存储", "बैकअप सहेजा गया", "تم حفظ النسخة الاحتياطية", "Sauvegarde enregistrée", "ব্যাকআপ সংরক্ষিত হয়েছে", "Backup salvo", "بیک اپ محفوظ ہو گیا", "Cadangan disimpan", "Backup gesichert", "バックアップを保存しました", "बॅकअप जतन केला", "బ్యాకప్ సేవ్ అయింది", "Yedek kaydedildi", "காப்புப்பிரதி சேமிக்கப்பட்டது", "Đã lưu bản sao lưu", "백업을 저장했습니다"],
